> Using Moods

```catala-metadata
#[test]
#[testcase.testui]
#[testcase.test_description = ""]
#[testcase.test_title = "Qualified names"]
declaration scope Paint_red:
  output calc scope Moods.Paint
```

```catala
scope Paint_red:
  definition calc.shade equals Moods.Colour.Red
  definition calc.box equals Moods.Box { -- x: 1 -- gone: 2 }
  assertion (calc.is_red = true)
```
